    "markdown": "---\ntitle: \"\"\npage-layout: full\n---\n\n::: {.hero-banner}\n# Central York Science Olympiad\n### Central York High School's award-winning STEM competition team​\n\n\n[Support Us](sponsor.qmd){.btn .btn-primary .btn-lg role=\"button\"}\n[Contact Us](contact.qmd){.btn .btn-primary .btn-lg role=\"button\"}\n:::\n\n## What We Do\n\nEach year, CYHS Science Olympiad brings two competing teams to invitationals across Pennsylvania and Maryland, typically attending six or more tournaments per season, with our top team advancing to the Central PA Regional Tournament and, when we qualify, the PA State Tournament. Competing across 23 events spanning science exams, laboratory work, and engineering builds, our 40+ students put months of practice to the test against some of the strongest teams in the state.\n\n## Recent Highlights\n\n### April 25, 2026 - Pennsylvania Science Olympiad State Tournament\n\n<div class=\"highlights-grid\"><div class=\"highlight-card\"><div class=\"highlight-logo\"><img src=\"images/Chemistry Lab.png\" alt=\"Chemistry Lab logo\"></div><div class=\"highlight-event\">Chemistry Lab</div><div class=\"highlight-place\">1st Place</div></div><div class=\"highlight-card\"><div class=\"highlight-logo\"><img src=\"images/Experimental Design.png\" alt=\"Experimental Design logo\"></div><div class=\"highlight-event\">Experimental Design</div><div class=\"highlight-place\">1st Place</div></div><div class=\"highlight-card\"><div class=\"highlight-logo\"><img src=\"images/Water Quality.png\" alt=\"Water Quality logo\"></div><div class=\"highlight-event\">Water Quality</div><div class=\"highlight-place\">3rd Place</div></div><div class=\"highlight-card\"><div class=\"highlight-logo\"><img src=\"images/Bungee Drop.png\" alt=\"Bungee Drop logo\"></div><div class=\"highlight-event\">Bungee Drop</div><div class=\"highlight-place\">4th Place</div></div><div class=\"highlight-card\"><div class=\"highlight-logo\"><img src=\"images/Rocks and Minerals.png\"